        "Structure": {
          "Structure_Text": {
            "original": "The alloy primarily comprises a fusion zone (FZ, ~80%) and a heat-affected zone (HAZ, near pool boundary). α-Al cells with amorphous cell boundaries enriched in Fe and Si forming a continuous 3D crystalline-amorphous interpenetrating network. Small amount (~1%) of Al8Fe2Si precipitates (1-2 μm). TiV nucleation cores (~50 nm) at grain centers. Nanoscale TiV particles (~12 nm) embedded within cells.",
            "simplified": "Fusion zone (~80%): α-Al cells (~67 nm diameter) + amorphous cell boundaries (~14 nm width, Fe/Si enriched) forming 3D interpenetrating network. HAZ at pool boundary. Minor Al8Fe2Si precipitates (~1%, 1-2 μm). TiV cores (~50 nm) at grain centers. TiV nanoparticles (~12 nm) within cells."
